<title>ITALY: Italy's Ciampi to hold news conference Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Italy's Ciampi to hold news conference Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi will hold a news conference in Rome on Tuesday to discuss the Treasury's plan to sell its 60 percent stake in the Banco Di Napoli.</p>
<p>The Treasury said the conference would be at 1400 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom 39 6 678 2501</p>
</text>
